[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg033a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，早上好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，早…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「昨天，真是可惜了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是，真的很开心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我只觉得好累啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不仅是这些。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还有什么啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「加深了友谊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好青春啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。我们几个，不论面对怎样的困难，只要齐心合力就可以克服。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽然自伤八百。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「即便是如此也没关系。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「面对困难…我觉得那是非常重要的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不管结果如何…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng36"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我们的内心，凝聚在了一起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「今后，也一定可以携手共进的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，能这样也不错。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「现在还不算吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「总之，重要的是将来对吧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"午休。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我带着渚，来到了自己的教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还没来啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我透过门看着春原的座位说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是不是还没从昨天的疲惫中恢复过来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要恢复的话，一时半会儿是不会来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「哎，为什么呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你可能不会懂吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请告诉我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「输掉比赛打击到他了。仅此而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「都已经这么努力了。真的好可惜。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「并没有什么好打击的。我觉得可以抬头挺胸。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以，我才说你不会懂的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我有说…什么错误的话吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「稍稍试着去理解一下那家伙的自尊和虚荣心吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「即使你这么说，我也不是很懂…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「既然不懂，就别管他了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等过一段时间，自然就会来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我做不到不管不问。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我很担心他…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「算了，要是连你都不关心他，那就没人关心了，这么说来也不坏…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君应该也很担心吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别擅自认定啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「所以…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「接下来，我们去春原同学的房间找他吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你啊，完全没有在听别人说话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为，我担心啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就算如此，也不好翘课吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，会在午休结束前回来的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「午休时外出，应该要外出许可的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去看看那家伙倒是没什么…只是很麻烦啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我去申请外出许可。朋也君就等等吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真去啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我去一下办公室。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等一下喂！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不等我阻止，渚就跑过了走廊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（算了，她担心也很正常…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（对于这家伙来说正是巩固友情的时候…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也跟随脚步，追了上去。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg016"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在办公室前，我静静等着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呆呆地望着告示板。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说起来…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（演剧部的说明会…不正是今天吗…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（现在的她，也没工夫做这些吧…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚从办公室出来后，看见我便走了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「久等了。已经拿到许可了，我们快去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们并排走了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「今天，是说明会的日子…谁都没有来呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这件事由渚说了出来。她注意到了啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且就算来了…也什么都做不成。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我安慰她似的说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「快点，不抓紧的话，午休结束前可赶不回来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛是抛下了不舍，渚快步走了起来。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原在睡觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，上茶来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我揪起他的耳朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…好疼！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，谁啊！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是我。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，这样叫他起来太可怜了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「连小渚都在…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「到底怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没啥，在想你是不是自暴自弃了，特地来安慰你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没错。春原同学，请打起精神。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，便跪坐在春原的枕边。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「没问题，我很好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那就起床，去学校吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊…嗯，再等一下就去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我想现在和你一起去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不，总之…等我有那个心情吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"输了比赛似乎让他相当难受。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟赛前对合唱部的人放了那么多狠话，结果却输了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（因为他，对传闻的在意程度远超普通人啊…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不可以等你的心情…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请告诉我，要怎么样你才肯去学校。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「他是觉得不好意思。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，这也是原因之一…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「自己一反常态去拼命加油，结束之后自然会泄气。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng12z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是这样啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是，以后在学校一定会发生许多开心的事的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「和我们一起度过这段时光吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我很感谢你的心意…但暂时让我泄气一会。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不可以…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么，我下周开始再去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「真的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，真的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我等你。还有朋也君也是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我的话和渚单独在一起会比较开心。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不可以说这种话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「两人独处…可以另外找时间。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我也想…和你单独在一起。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我果然是电灯泡？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没有，才没这种事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我们等你回学校，一定要回来哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，我知道了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚，时间。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，我们得回去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚终于站起身。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我们走了，春原同学，下周见。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「谢谢你，小渚。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们来看我，我很高兴。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你这样说就像是马上要领便当的角色啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不准说这种不吉利的话！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚，快走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该是在连休的时候彻底调整好了心情，春原如约在休假结束后开始来上学了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然一如既往地会迟到。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":6444,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]